th of a tragedy  there's a lot of interest in political  will but 30 60 90 days out the only  folks that are still concerned about  this are gun owners who are totally  opposed to changes in the Second  Amendment that dynamic alex has started  to change you've seen these groups prop  up since the Sandy Hook tragedy in 2012  that now on a regular basis are putting  pressure on lawmakers to take a position  to enact legislation that would make  changes you've got two bills right now  in Congress just when to make concealed  carry laws that have reciprocity across  state lines and another that would allow  silencers on certain weapons Republicans  had planned to vote on these things  actually this week this past week  delayed those these gun right these gun  control groups the groups that are run  by former New York Mayor Michael  Bloomberg there's a large group of  mothers who've been pushing for changes  in gun laws for years have continued to  put the pressure on Democrats and some  Republicans and you know the Senate is  off this coming week that group was  telling me yesterday they plan to try to  find especially moderate Democrats who  in the past perhaps have been skittish  about this and try to get them on the  record to say that they support making  changes in gun policy and what is it  about bump stocks that suddenly has even  groups like the NRA you know willing to  consider regulation well two things  first of all did you know what one was a  week ago no sir I think 99.9 percent of  Americans didn't and that's the point is  that they realized suddenly this obscure  device could cause such incredible  carnage the other was frankly just the  scope of the death and and the injuries  that were caused in this shooting and  John McCain and other Republicans just  said look Americans are horrified they  the idea that somebody can do this with  a device that none of us knew about is  something that we have to pause and  consider and so whether it's done  through changes in ATF regulations or  legislation in the coming weeks in  either way they realize that this is  something that at least has to be  discussed all right ed O'Keefe in  Washington this morning thanks ed take  care
 

